Hi,

I'm in Level 5, got two bones piles, killed lots of orcs and found a WoW
in a shop :-).  Now i got tons of armour and other items to polymorph,
but there's one problem: no altar.  So, after wishing for the usual stuff
(gray dragon scale mail, amulet of life saving, 3 cursed scrolls of genocide)
I wished for a "lawful altar".  Hmm, doesn't work.  So, I used the wish for
a wand of polymorph (which I wanted to wish for anyway), but I don't want
to start polypiling without finding out the blessed/cursed status of all 
those items.  Looks like I have to keep searching for an altar.

Ok, here's my proposal for 3.1 (or whatever the version number will be):
Make it possible to wish for "furniture": altars (including alignment),
fountains, kitchen sinks, traps (including type, i.e. "level teleport trap").
Wishing for throne should have the same effect as wishing for a WoW, the
throne should instantly vanish when you sit on it.


